<title>USA: DuPont pays a lot to fulfill strategic aims.</title>
<headline>DuPont pays a lot to fulfill strategic aims.</headline>
<byline>David Chance</byline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, July 14 - DuPont Co is paying a high price to become a global player in the polyester, polymer and pigments business by buying half of ICI Plc's bulk chemicals assets, but analysts say the deal is a long term winner.</p>
<p>The businesses are either emerging from or on the verge of overcoming a harsh pricing environment and there could be a few years more pain, they added.</p>
</text>
